## Cross-cutting note for the dev
Three failures repeat across ALL three workflows and should be fixed ONCE in shared code, not per-document:
- **Wrong-column read** (regulatory limit vs vendor content): RS-1 (Opadry) = EI-2 (Aerosil). One shared rule: content column feeds the calculation; the limit column feeds only the comparison row.
- **Multi-material annexure**: RS-5 = EI-3 (IFF PRDS → MCC + Croscarmellose). One shared many-to-many mapping fix.
- **Material-name/code fallback**: RS-3 (name → API name) and DEG-2/DEG-1 (code blank/misread) are the same "read the real identity from filename/template column, never the product name, never re-OCR a clean value."
Fixing these three in the shared identity/annexure/limit modules clears the majority of the tickets above in one pass.
